  "recordedNote": "Shapes taken from MasterRecordController@store/@show/@update and HasResponse on 25 Nov 2026. Replayed against the real routes by dms-api tests/Feature/FormPlus/RecordContractTest.php (25 Nov 2026). Two shapes differed and were corrected in this file: validationError is HTTP 200 + success:false + message Validation error (not 422), and loadRecord json_data returns date values as DD-MM-YYYY (not YYYY-MM-DD). fORM- tests read only the keys listed in rules.",
  "v2Cases": {
    "$comment": "ADDITIVE (run dmsplus-int, SEC-DESIGN.md 5.2.5-8): masked reads (a secret is the mask plus <name>__masked: true; a hidden field is absent for non-revealers), the mask and hidden keys refused on write, and a partial PATCH that keeps the untouched secret. Cases are {name, as, request, response, then?} like the rest of this file; `as` names the seeded user (owner reveals hidden fields, editor does not). Master Vendor Register (a1...b1) has Vendor Name, Vendor Code, Tax Id (secret) and Internal Note (hidden).",
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "load-masked-for-non-revealer",
        "as": "editor",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/dms/master-records/d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1?master_id=a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1"
        },
        "response": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "success": true,
            "message": "Master retrieved successfully",
            "data": {
              "id": "d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
              "master_id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
              "primary_key_value": "Acme",
              "json_data": "{\"Vendor Name\":\"Acme\",\"Vendor Code\":\"1042\",\"Tax Id\":\"••••••\",\"Tax Id__masked\":true}",
              "created_at": "2026-11-25 10:00:00",
              "updated_at": "2026-11-25 10:00:00"
            }
          }
        },
        "note": "S = the mask plus S__masked: true; H (Internal Note) is absent"
      },
      {
        "name": "load-masked-for-revealer",
        "as": "owner",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/dms/master-records/d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1?master_id=a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1"
        },
        "response": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "success": true,
            "message": "Master retrieved successfully",
            "data": {
              "id": "d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
              "master_id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
              "primary_key_value": "Acme",
              "json_data": "{\"Vendor Name\":\"Acme\",\"Vendor Code\":\"1042\",\"Tax Id\":\"••••••\",\"Tax Id__masked\":true,\"Internal Note\":\"call back after the audit\"}",
              "created_at": "2026-11-25 10:00:00",
              "updated_at": "2026-11-25 10:00:00"
            }
          }
        },
        "note": "a revealer also gets H; S stays masked for everyone (plaintext only through the audited reveal route)"
      },
      {
        "name": "update-with-the-mask-as-value",
        "as": "editor",
        "request": {
          "method": "PATCH",
          "path": "/dms/master-records/d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
          "body": {
            "master_id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
            "json_data": {
              "Tax Id": "••••••"
            },
            "master_record_id": "d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1"
          }
        },
        "response": {
          "status": 422,
          "body": {
            "success": false,
            "code": "SECRET_MASK_NOT_ALLOWED"
          }
        },
        "then": {
          "stored_unchanged": [
            "Tax Id"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "update-with-a-masked-key",
        "as": "editor",
        "request": {
          "method": "PATCH",
          "path": "/dms/master-records/d3000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
          "body": {
